 1. Classification Use Case (RandomForestClassifier):
Predict whether a user will like a movie or not (Yes/No, rating >= 4)
🎯 Goal: Classify movie ratings as "Like" or "Dislike"
🎯 Use: RandomForestClassifier

🔢 2. Regression Use Case (RandomForestRegressor):
Predict the actual rating a user will give (e.g., 3.5, 4.0, etc.)
🎯 Goal: Predict exact rating